## P2: Build System Updates

**Status**: Not Started
**Effort**: Medium (6-10 hours)
**Dependencies**: P1 Application Lifecycle Migration
**Spec Reference**: User requirements for deployment
**Status Reference**: STATUS-libgdx-migration.md (Build system impact section)

### Description
Update Gradle build to replace JOGL dependencies with LibGDX, handle native libraries for all platforms, and update fat JAR packaging.

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Add LibGDX dependencies to build.gradle
- [ ] Remove JOGL download tasks
- [ ] Remove JOGL dependency from fileTree includes
- [ ] Add LibGDX natives for all target platforms:
  - macOS ARM64 (Apple Silicon)
  - macOS x86_64 (Intel)
  - Linux x86_64
  - Linux ARM64 (Raspberry Pi 4)
  - Linux ARMhf (Raspberry Pi 3)
- [ ] Update fatJar task to include LibGDX natives
- [ ] Test native library loading on at least 2 platforms
- [ ] Update .gitignore for LibGDX temp files
- [ ] Update any run scripts/configurations for new main class
- [ ] Document build process changes in README/docs

### Technical Notes
**Dependencies to Add**:
```gradle
ext {
    gdxVersion = '1.12.1' // Latest stable
}

dependencies {
    // Core LibGDX
    implementation "com.badlogicgames.gdx:gdx:$gdxVersion"

    // Desktop backend (LWJGL3)
    implementation "com.badlogicgames.gdx:gdx-backend-lwjgl3:$gdxVersion"

    // Platform natives
    implementation "com.badlogicgames.gdx:gdx-platform:$gdxVersion:natives-desktop"

    // OR for more control, separate natives:
    runtimeOnly "com.badlogicgames.gdx:gdx-platform:$gdxVersion:natives-desktop"
    runtimeOnly "com.badlogicgames.gdx:gdx-platform:$gdxVersion:natives-arm64"
    // ... etc for each platform

    // Keep Processing core for utilities (temporarily)
    implementation fileTree(dir: 'lib/processing-core', include: ['core.jar'])
}
```

**Dependencies to Remove**:
```gradle
// REMOVE these lines:
// Download/unzip Processing 4 JOGL libraries
task downloadProcessing4CoreLibrary(...)
task untarProcessing4CoreLibrary(...)

// REMOVE from fileTree includes:
// lib/jogl-4.0/**/*.jar
```

**Fat JAR Configuration**:
```gradle
tasks.register('fatJar', Jar) {
    manifest {
        attributes 'Main-Class': 'app.TesseractMain'
    }
    archiveBaseName = 'TesseractFatJar'
    duplicatesStrategy = DuplicatesStrategy.EXCLUDE

    from {
        configurations.runtimeClasspath.collect {
            it.isDirectory() ? it : zipTree(it)
        }
    }

    // Explicitly include LibGDX natives
    from {
        configurations.runtimeClasspath.findAll {
            it.name.contains('natives')
        }.collect { zipTree(it) }
    }

    with jar
}
```

**Platform Testing**:
- Test on macOS ARM64 (primary development)
- Test on Linux x86_64 (if available)
- Test headless mode on Raspberry Pi
- Document any platform-specific issues

